sequenceDiagram
    participant C as RTMP Client
    participant P as Proxy
    participant A as Controller
    participant S as State ConfigMap

    C->>P: Publish /live/streamX
    P->>A: POST /streams/started(streamX, proxyPod)
    A->>A: Register/validate Proxy ownership
    A->>S: Persist owner and generation
    A-->>P: registered or idempotent_replay

    loop Proxy health reconciliation
        A->>P: Read readiness and GET /health
        alt failure threshold reached
            A->>A: Expire affected ownership
            A->>S: Persist state
        end
    end

    C--xP: End publish
    P->>A: POST /streams/ended(streamX, proxyPod, generation?)
    A->>A: Validate current owner/generation
    alt current event
        A->>S: Remove and persist ownership
        A-->>P: ended
    else stale event
        A-->>P: stale_event_ignored
    end

    Note over A: No Worker Pod lifecycle in this cleanup phase
